A block at an item content column ends its paragraph before an unclosed fence

````
::: note
- para
  [r]: /u
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <ul>
    <li>para</li>
  </ul>
  <pre><code>code
::::
</code></pre>
</aside>
<p>after <strong>b</strong></p>
````

````
::: note
- para
  [^f]: n
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <ul>
    <li>para</li>
  </ul>
  <div>

  </div>
</aside>
<p>after <strong>b</strong></p>
````

